  triage:headSha "758732cd" ;
  triage:evidence "Boundary violation proof: dead-code annotation explicitly states the function is retained for tests only but no longer used in production dispatch, yet remains in production codebase as dead weight in the transport layer module tree. Production code path has shifted to persist_replay_request_to_endpoint (explicit-endpoint version), but dead code is not removed." ;
  triage:occursIn <urn:atm:triage:worktree/s21/758732cd> .

